# Excluded from lychee link checking (one regex per line).
# Auto-loaded by lychee from the repository root.
# Vendored README links are NOT handled here: docs/node_modules/ is kept out
# via the one-level input globs in .github/workflows/docs.yaml instead.
# Local dev addresses can never resolve in CI — nothing listens on the
# runner — so checking them only produces false positives (or hangs).
http://localhost.*
http://127\.0\.0\.1.*
# pocketbase.io: automated TLS clients deterministically fail verification
# here (expired-chain/UnknownIssuer errors, reproduced identically on GitHub
# runners and locally via act, lychee v0.24.2) while system TLS succeeds.
# External, unfixable from this repo — revisit if the host chain changes.
https://pocketbase\.io.*
# Project Pages URL: 404 until the first successful Pages deploy goes live.
# Revisit (remove) once https://arief-fajri.github.io/pgbase/ serves 200;
# until then it would fail the check on every run. Same TLS note as above.
https://arief-fajri\.github\.io.*
